<title>POLAND: VISCOPLAST 97 PRE-TAX TO FALL AFTER FLOOD.</title>
<headline>VISCOPLAST 97 PRE-TAX TO FALL AFTER FLOOD.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish chemical firm Viscoplast SA said on Monday that July's floods will cost it 8.2 million zlotys in additional spending, which has pushed its 1997 pre-tax profit forecast down 700,000 zlotys to 3.8 million.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement its sales forecast for 1997 has been revised down by six million zlotys to 46.3 million.</p>
<p>Viscoplast is due to resume trade on the bourse's parallel market on August 13.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
